"Later, the Blazing Swords and Tiger-Leopard Outriders recruit fresh ignites from sectless villages."
"Blazing Sword recruits get free rations of rice, dried meat, fish and potatoes."
"Later, the Alliance trains sectless recruits on ownerless ancestral techniques."
"Later, the Alliance runs a command room with a map and transmission stones to every sect."
"By autumn, the Alliance sees about 20 breakthrough parties in six months, not 3 a cycle."
"Within two years of the Alliance, Azure Hills cultivator talent roughly doubles."
"Later, some independents conspire against the Alliance, resenting the sects' growing power."
"Later, the Alliance defeats the Yellow Empress, losing 2 cultivators and about 46 Blaze Bears."
"Later, the Alliance builds a Hall of Heroes in the mountain for all its fallen."
"Later, the Alliance lays kinless fallen to rest itself, as their family."
